The '''Worker's District''' was a district of the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[desert]] [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. Following the collapse of [[Jabba's criminal empire]] after his [[death]], [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba's]] [[majordomo]], [[Bib Fortuna]], assumed the title of [[lord]] and claimed Jabba's throne. He split Mos Espa into three families, the [[Strassi family]] operated in the [[Mos Espa city center|city center]], the [[Aqualish crime family]] operated in the Worker's District, and the [[Tatooine Klatooinian family|Klatooinian family]] operated in the [[upper sprawl]] and [[Mos Espa spaceport|spaceport]].<ref name="Chapter 3" />
